      },
      "text": "Sensors are the robot's interface to physical reality. Two categories:\nproprioceptive (self-sensing: what are my joints doing?) and exteroceptive\n(world-sensing: what is in the environment?)."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-SENSORS.md#003",
      "path": [
        "03-SENSORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:03-sensors, git-history:robotics:03-sensors]",
        "canonical_path": "robotics/03-SENSORS.md",
        "concepts": "[sensors]",
        "current_path": "robotics/03-SENSORS.md",
        "id": "maxim:robotics:sensors",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "robotics",
