        "section": "robotics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Sensors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MAGNETIC ENCODER: Hall effect + magnetic pole disk.\n  Less precise than optical but more robust (IP67+).\n  Resolution: 12-16 bit.\n  Common in harsh environments (welding, outdoor)."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-SENSORS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "03-SENSORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:03-sensors, git-history:robotics:03-sensors]",
