        "section": "robotics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Sensors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "QUADRATURE DECODING:\n  Two channels A and B, 90 degrees phase offset.\n  Decoding A/B transitions gives direction + 4x resolution.\n  A___----____----   <- channel A\n  B_----____----_   <- channel B (90 deg shifted)\n  Rising edge of A with B=0: forward. B=1: reverse."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-SENSORS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "03-SENSORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:03-sensors, git-history:robotics:03-sensors]",
